id: T-247
title: 普通终端里交互式 Codex 的钩子认不出是哪个 CLI，会话号和回合状态都报不上来
type: build
status: open
blocked_by: []
claimed_by:
supersedes:
ready: yes
ready_by: executor
ready_rev: 1
